<main>
  
<h1 class="header_title mx-a max-w-4xl px-16 md:px-36">Pricing</h1>





<div class="mt-24 mb-48 mx-a max-w-4xl px-16 md:px-36">
  <div class="mx-a fs-18 max-w-lg text-center">
    Kagi has no ads, no tracking, no noise, and is fully funded by its users. We deliver fast, private, high-quality search. By joining, you&#39;re not just paying for a service; you&#39;re helping build a better web.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="relative z-1">
  <div class="onb_tabs mx-a max-w-4xl px-16 md:px-36">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-24">
